  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fccc780f-ef36-43c0-b6e4-487406319788.png\"></p><div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>饲养&nbsp; &nbsp;有生命力的&nbsp; &nbsp;家畜</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/PVVDJ7YE7b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline-block;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lhm7THS.png\" alt=\"加入我们的Discord服务器\" width=\"131\" height=\"33\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fathisworkshop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi5.png?v=6\" alt=\"在ko-fi.com请我喝咖啡\" width=\"131\" height=\"33\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fathisworkshop.dev%252fwiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/f7kB6Qc.png\" alt=\"Wiki\" width=\"131\" height=\"33\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">《畜牧养殖》将被动型农场动物变成你世界中生动的一部分。动物拥有护理需求、遗传基因、性格特征、疾病系统、繁殖控制以及特殊的互动机制，让牧场管理更接近真实畜群，而不仅仅是照看几个生物。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>概述</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b8b6a765-56fd-4a81-b3fb-d939336bd0b7.png\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">本模组添加了一套完整的动物护理系统，涵盖驯化、幸福度、遗传基因、健康状况和高级喂养。专为希望农耕和动物繁殖更具深度、个性化和长期发展性的玩家设计。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_67a8232a-0199-4a43-b918-a04a7a7f1768.png\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">&nbsp;通过喂食动物喜爱的食物来驯化它们。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">&nbsp;通过幸福度、疾病、饥饿、脱水及梳毛需求，长期追踪动物护理状态。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">&nbsp;使用刷子恢复幸福度，保持动物良好状态。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">&nbsp;用动物药物治愈生病的动物。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">&nbsp;使用放大镜查看动物的遗传基因和护理统计。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">&nbsp;通过农场账本查看更详细的动物报告。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">&nbsp;使用生育药水提升繁殖准备度，优化一个繁殖周期的基因遗传。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">&nbsp;繁殖动物可继承遗传基因，包括性格、颜色、花纹、产量、生育力、成长速度和体质。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">&nbsp;使用饲料槽喂养和给水动物。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">&nbsp;让猪有机会在地面搜寻松露。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">&nbsp;支持多种性格特征：贪吃、爱抱抱、暴躁、精力旺盛以及无特征。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">&nbsp;添加物种特色行为，如更高产量、更快成长速度以及基于性格的增益效果。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">&nbsp;本模组还为整合包作者提供了可配置的游戏玩法系统，您可以调整体验难度以适应硬核生存包、温馨农场主题世界，或介于两者之间的风格。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">游戏玩法亮点</span></strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">动物不再仅仅是装饰品。它们可以被驯化，通过悉心照料获得幸福度，被忽视时会生病，并随时间推移对你的管理决策做出反应。</span></div>\n<br>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">猪可以在合适的方块上挖掘松露，其行为会根据遗传基因和护理状态而变化。松露搜寻还能改变地形，将草地变为泥土，泥土变为粗泥。</span></div>\n<br>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">饲料槽可储存食物和水，让牧场管理更自动化，减少重复操作。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>支持平台</strong></span></h3>\n<br>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">Fabric</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">NeoForge</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>需求环境</strong></span></h3>\n<br>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">Minecraft 1.21.1</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">Java 21</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">Architectury</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">备注</span></strong></h3>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">本模组仍处于早期访问阶段。可能出现漏洞。如果发现任何问题，请随时在Discord上报告。</span></div>\n<div><br>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">本模组聚焦于游戏玩法的深度，而非一次性新奇物品。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">平衡性设计可配置，整合包可自行决定动物护理的惩罚或宽容程度。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e5d278\">如果您在制作整合包，配置文件是调整难度和进程的主要工具。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
